#: apps/mail/templates/mail/not_connected.html:8
msgid ""
"Once the owner connects the company e-mail address, everyone who works on "
"documents can read and write company mail here, without leaving MyDocHub."
msgstr ""
"وقتی مالک نشانی ایمیل شرکت را متصل کند، همه کسانی که روی اسناد کار می‌کنند "
